Month = {WIN},
Abstract = {In the past two decades, obesity has become more prevalent in the
   population and more prominent in politics and the press. This article
   reviews Americans' assessments of their own personal weight situation,
   evaluations of the seriousness of obesity as a public health issue,
   understandings of the causes of obesity, and attitudes toward government
   policies aimed at addressing obesity, with an emphasis on examining
   trends in the past ten to fifteen years. While obesity has become a
   source of increasing personal concern and a more recognized public
   health issue, there is little public consensus around whether and how
   government should intervene.},
