   Research Agency (ANR) as part of the `Investissements d'Avenir'
   programme LIEPP {[}ANR-11-LABX-0091, ANR-11-IDEX-0005-02]},
Funding-Text = {We are especially grateful to Cornell Clayton and the anonymous
   reviewers for helpful comments and suggestions as well as to Chantal
   Barry for the editing of the manuscript. Previous versions of this
   article have greatly benefitted from their presentation at the 2010 DVPW
   Sektionstagung Vergleichende Politikwissenschaft, at the 2010 IPSA
   Research Committee 09 Interim Meeting and at the 2010 MPSA Annual
